Queries read-only JSON evidence from one app instance, not a fleet total

Usage: leptoskit infra analytics [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --app-target <NAME>  Select a named target from the root leptoskit.toml
  -h, --help               Print help
  -V, --version            Print version
